<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes Chemical cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes Chemical cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Thursday it had cut its rating for Great Lakes Chemical Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Great Lakes shares fell 1-1/2 to 50-5/8 in mid-morning trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
